  "description": "A goalkeeper..168cm?!  \nGoalkeeper Baek Seung-won was kicked out of the soccer team because of his short stature and transferred to another school. Although he vowed not to even look at a soccer ball, he meets his new destiny when he meets a futsal team called 'Goraniez'.  \nBaek Seung-won and Goraniz's hot coming-of-age drama!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=824700), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11097796)\n\n**Official Translation:**  \n[T.Chinese](https://www.webtoons.com/zh-hant/school/goleiro/list?title_no=6795), [Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0003617)",
